## Key Commands
```bash
py -m orchestrator status           # Check current state
py -m orchestrator run              # Execute current phase
py -m orchestrator advance          # Apply transition
py -m orchestrator accept           # Approve human gate
py -m orchestrator validate         # Validate artifacts
py -m pytest -q                     # Run tests
```
